# MeterReadAI & WaterFlow — Windsurf Cascade Rules

## Project Overview
MeterReadAI is an AI-powered water meter reading (YOLO11-seg + OCR) and automated billing management system (WaterFlow).

## Tech Stack Requirements
1. Frontend: React 18+, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS v3+
2. UI Prototype: Google Stitch (https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/3346993615529581711)
3. Backend: FastAPI (Python 3.10+), Pydantic v2
4. AI Model: YOLO11-seg + OpenCV
5. Database: SQLite + SQLAlchemy 2.0 ORM
6. API Design: RESTful API (/api/v1)
7. Deployment: Docker & Docker Compose
8. Testing: Pytest

## Domain Integrity & Rules
- Always validate: currentIndex >= previousIndex. If not, trigger Abnormality flow.
- Preserve leading zeros in reading sequences (keep as String).
- Immutable AI records: Never overwrite AIRecognition. Log all human corrections with reasons in MeterReading.
- Snapshot tariffs: Save InvoiceTierDetail for each invoice to ensure historical calculation reproducibility.
- TDD & Verification: Run pytest to verify before marking any task as complete.
